cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper (preferred-citation) and this repository."
title: "sc1p-scbm: exact SC1P and SCBM solvers for synteny histories"
abstract: "Reference implementation of the SAT encoding of the Sandwich Consecutive Ones Property (SC1P) and the precedence MaxSAT encoding of the Sandwich Consecutive-Block Minimization (SCBM) problem on ternary matrices, together with the event matrices of synteny trees."
